OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome cloud at first but bright
OL,6,For sunny spells will soon develop,
OL,7,Flasting much of the day before turning
OL,8,Fcloudier again later in the afternoon.
OL,9,FFeeling quite warm and staying dry and
OL,10,Fwinds mainly moderate from the east or
OL,11,Fsoutheast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying dry through the
OL,14,Fevening with areas of low cloud but
OL,15,Falso some clearer breaks at times.
OL,16,FOutbreaks of rain will spread north
OL,17,Fthrough the early hours with
OL,18,Ffreshening winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
