OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain,
OL,6,Flikely turning heavy at times through
OL,7,Fthe afternoon. Strengthening
OL,8,Fnortheasterly winds developing.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRain
OL,11,Fand stronger winds clearing early
OL,12,FSaturday. Then some drier and bright
OL,13,Fspells over the weekend and on Monday
OL,14,Fbut also a few showers at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
